    "body": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Post Status has outlined its strategic policy plan for 2025-2027. The plan aims to support innovation and foster collaboration within the global open-source software community, with a particular emphasis on WordPress.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The foundation actively manages a vibrant community through platforms like Slack, podcasts, newsletters, and dedicated websites, such as <a href=\"https://poststatus.com\">poststatus.com</a> and <a href=\"http://wpspeakers.com\">wpspeakers.com</a>. Key objectives include maintaining and slightly increasing the community&#8217;s size and engagement levels, doubling website traffic within three years, and enhancing support for both online and offline educational events.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Financially, Post Status relies on sponsorships, memberships, and donations, targeting an annual income of €50,000 to €60,000. Efforts are focused on making membership more accessible, aiming to reduce fees while boosting community investments. Expenses primarily cover community platforms, events, educational resources, and essential administrative functions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The foundation maintains prudent financial practices, building a small reserve to ensure continuity and stability. Regular evaluations, transparent stakeholder communications, and the publication of annual financial reports underline its commitment to accountability and openness.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Post Status is committed to nurturing an inclusive, innovative community that enhances the web&#8217;s accessibility and openness for all.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The complete policy plan, <a href=\"https://poststatus.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Beleidsplan-Stichting-Post-Status-2025-2027.pdf\">in Dutch, can be found here</a>.</p>\n",
